---
import Welcome from "../components/Welcome.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../style/styles.css";
---

<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="seccion-1">
      <h1>One gesture can shape the future</h1>
      <p>
        <strong>ISDIN</strong> and <strong
          >World Congress of Dermatology 2027</strong
        > (WCD) have joined forces to create a global movement with a shared purpose:<strong
          >to inspire a future without skin cancer.</strong
        > This alliance is based on science, education, and a genuine commitment to
        prevention, with the aim of <strong
          >bringing daily sun protection to everyone, everywhere in the world.</strong
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        Now it’s your turn to join: <strong
          >share a photo of yourself protecting your skin</strong
        > from the sun and be part of the movement. Participants will be entered into
        a draw to win passes to experience WCD 2027. <strong
          >Together, for a future without skin cancer.</strong
        >
      </p>

      <a aria-label="botón para unirse al reto" href="#join" class="join-button"
        >JOIN NOW</a
      >
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
